# build outputs — setup.sh builds a host-native monocypher shared library in a scratch dir
# (never in-tree), but ignore it here in case someone runs the forge tooling by hand.
monocypher.so
*.o
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: `db-restore` (the prebuilt ARM64 Linux binary) is committed *source material*, not a
# build output — the vessel ships it prebuilt and only forges the backup per build. Do not
# add it here.
